hen supplied); OR a more concise change would meet the same acceptance criteria — name the smaller change; OR the diff hand-rolls logic an existing helper/util/hook already provides — name the helper to reuse (verify with the existing-code tool when available). Prefer reuse over new code; fewer lines is always better. Do NOT approve an over-engineered fix merely because it satisfies the AC wording.

